Move to 1: Mark as visited. Print 1.
Move to 2: Mark as visited. Print 2.
Move to 3: Mark as visited. Print 3.(backtrack to 2)
Move to 4: Mark as visited. Print 4(backtrack to 2, then backtrack to 1, then to 0).

